-- of the information required by section 4A(b) ... or such sale". Only the
-- (b)(1) transition applies.
@ref § 227.503(a)(4)
GIVEN person IS A CoveredPerson
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`503(a)(4) — a Commission registration order` person MEANS
        "(4)" ... person's `subject to an order of the Commission under section 15(b) or 15B(c) of the Exchange Act or section 203(e) or (f) of the Investment Advisers Act`
    AND `the Commission order does what (i), (ii) or (iii) describes` person
    AND `not caught by the transition in paragraph (b)(1)` (person's `date the Commission order under section 15(b), 15B(c) or Advisers Act 203(e) or (f) was entered`)

@ref § 227.503(a)(5)(i)-(ii)
GIVEN person IS A CoveredPerson
