`the cease-and-desist order is of a kind described in (i) or (ii)` person MEANS
        "(i)"  ... person's `subject to a Commission order to cease and desist from committing or causing a violation of a scienter-based anti-fraud provision of the Federal securities laws`
    ..  "(ii)" ... person's `subject to a Commission order to cease and desist from committing or causing a violation of section 5 of the Securities Act`

