    AND person's `that cease-and-desist order is in effect at the time of such filing or sale`
    AND `falls within the lookback of` (person's `date the Commission cease-and-desist order was entered`) `the filing` `the five year disqualification lookback`
    AND `not caught by the transition in paragraph (b)(1)` (person's `date the Commission cease-and-desist order was entered`)

